      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It was announced in the discord and more. The reason why it is prohibited is because it would cause hundreds of people to also load up the same map with minor variations and clog the world approval list. What I have to say is don't wprry too.much about this, it's YOUR homeworld and no one elses. If you're worried about no one seeing it, then don't. Those home sdks are ment to be your own, not to impress anyone else.",
